# AVISM Experiment Manifest File
# Created: 2026-06-17
# Purpose: Documentation of the last three experiments (Runs 1, 2, and 3) to guide optimal configuration selection.

================================================================================
EXPERIMENT RUNS COMPARISON MATRIX
================================================================================

